{"ticker":"MSI","updated":"2026-10-30T23:00:06Z","profile":{"longName":"Motorola Solutions, Inc.","shortName":"Motorola Solutions, Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Communication Equipment","country":"United States","website":"https://www.motorolasolutions.com","fullTimeEmployees":23000,"marketCap":81345167360,"trailingPE":38.70315,"forwardPE":25.296593,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":6.6474767,"pegRatio":2.16,"targetMeanPrice":526.9091,"targetHighPrice":550.0,"targetLowPrice":476.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":11,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.133,"earningsGrowth":0.095,"grossMargins":0.52112,"operatingMargins":0.27354,"profitMargins":0.17438999,"totalRevenue":12236999680,"beta":0.886,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":498.57,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":359.36,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.98},"summary":"Motorola Solutions, Inc. provides public safety, government, defense, and enterprise security solutions in the United States, the United Kingdom, Canada, and internationally. It operates in two segments, Products and Systems Integration, and Software and Services. The Products and Systems Integration segment offers a portfolio of infrastructure, devices, accessories, and the implementation and integration of systems, devices, software, and applications for government, including defense, public safety, and enterprise customers who operate private communications systems and video security solutions, as well as manage a mobile workforce. This segment also provides mission critical networks, and video security and access control technologies, including two-way portable and vehicle-mounted radios, video cameras, and accessories; communications network core and central processing software, base stations, consoles, and repeaters; and video analytics, network video management hardware and software, and access control solutions. The Software and Services segment offers public safety and enterprise command center, unified communications applications, mobile video equipment, and video software solutions; repair, technical support, and maintenance services; and monitoring, software updates, and cybersecurity services to government, public safety, and commercial communications networks. It ","summary_zh":"Motorola Solutions, Inc. 在美國、英國、加拿大和國際上提供公共安全、政府、國防和企業安全解決方案。它分為兩個部門：產品和系統整合部門以及軟體和服務部門。產品和系統整合部門為政府（包括國防、公共安全和營運專用通訊系統和視訊安全解決方案以及管理行動員工的企業客戶）提供基礎設施、設備、配件以及系統、設備、軟體和應用程式的實施和整合。該部門還提供關鍵任務網路、視訊安全和存取控制技術，包括雙向便攜式和車載無線電、攝影機和配件；通訊網路核心和中央處理軟體、基地台、控制台和中繼器；和視訊分析、網路視訊管理硬體和軟體以及存取控制解決方案。軟體和服務部門提供公共安全和企業指揮中心、統一通訊應用、行動視訊設備和視訊軟體解決方案；維修、技術支援和維護服務；為政府、公共安全和商業通訊網路提供監控、軟體更新和網路安全服務。它","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"通訊設備","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":469.96,"h":479.23,"l":466.7,"c":479.0,"v":1615000},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":477.5,"h":479.44,"l":470.26,"c":474.16,"v":796300},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":476.65,"h":478.89,"l":475.58,"c":478.62,"v":608200},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":479.03,"h":480.19,"l":475.29,"c":478.98,"v":631200},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":477.75,"h":478.82,"l":474.17,"c":478.37,"v":935200},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":477.1,"h":478.8,"l":473.03,"c":477.93,"v":597500},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":477.56,"h":484.09,"l":476.5,"c":481.7,"v":701100},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":481.05,"h":492.22,"l":480.28,"c":490.3,"v":1046600},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":487.97,"h":487.97,"l":481.29,"c":481.71,"v":793100},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":479.75,"h":485.56,"l":479.75,"c":482.43,"v":885300},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":482.0,"h":484.23,"l":475.25,"c":476.84,"v":1021500},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":477.82,"h":479.79,"l":475.78,"c":477.85,"v":721100},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":477.0,"h":478.44,"l":471.44,"c":474.55,"v":791400},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":476.67,"h":478.7,"l":471.68,"c":476.21,"v":1676600},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":476.67,"h":477.52,"l":471.46,"c":471.47,"v":789900},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":471.36,"h":474.16,"l":468.78,"c":470.72,"v":1067100},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":468.72,"h":471.1,"l":455.0,"c":455.13,"v":957500},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":456.01,"h":457.83,"l":454.32,"c":455.73,"v":77